      {
       "src": "h4",
       "t": 27.0,
       "x": 0.7,
       "zoom": 1.1,
       "speed": 0.55
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And then comes the best line: you can't just let her out, you'll mess up the ecology. You guys care about that, right?",
